Thursday, January 11, 2024
Call To Order
Chairman Caughey called the meeting to order at 3:30 p.m. Guests were welcomed to the
meeting and the  assembly joined in the Pledge of Allegiance.
Chairman Caughey announced that there will be an Open House on January 24, 2024 from 3:00
p.m. to 5:00 p.m. to answer questions on the proposed changes to the Laramie County Land Use
Regulations. The Open House will be held at Archer at the Planning Development office.
Also, the meeting for January 25, 2024 has been cancelled since there are no agenda items. The
next meeting will be February 8, 2024.
Roll Call
Jason Caughey, Jack Stadel, Natacha Gaspar,
Mark Smith
