Justin Arnold, Planning Program Manager, said that the proposed Ironhorse, 3rd
Filing is a 71-acre subdivision with16 residential lots, averaging 5.25 acres each. The
proposed development will be accessed primarily by Yellowstone Road, though it may
also be accessed by Hynds Boulevard. The Preliminary Development Plan was
approved by the Planning Commission on May 11, 2023, with the condition that the
